  {
   "id": "ms_msg_0a7c3e51",
   "thread_id": "ms_thread_3c9e71a4",
   "sender_id": "contact_624483321982237cde191eea",
   "text": "Hey Kofi, sorry to message so late on a Saturday. I saw your Pioneer SX-780 on Marketplace for $425 (facebook.com/marketplace/item/fbml_5401). Is it still available? I'm pretty new to vintage gear so bear with me if I ask basic stuff 👍",
